      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The village’s attractions spread beyond its limits, offering museums, historic forts, and wild nature reserves that tell Ohio’s story.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
